"$accent", "content": "Light · 选中第 1 行，鼠标悬停第 8 行", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fontWeight": "600"}, {"type": "text", "id": "EfjM8", "name": "Note 1", "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "每行两行字：上面是内容本身（主色），下面一行淡灰的“来源 App · 多久前”。", "lineHeight": 1.5, "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 14, "fontWeight": "normal"}, {"type": "text", "id": "oU0HG", "name": "Note 2", "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "时间常驻，但放在内容下面、用 12 pt 灰字，不和内容抢。右侧不放任何图标。", "lineHeight": 1.5, "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 14, "fontWeight": "normal"}, {"type": "text", "id": "F6847i", "name": "Note 3", "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "图片、颜色、文件在最左侧有一个真实预览（缩略图 / 色条 / 文件图标）；纯文字行不加，直接从左边开始。", "lineHeight": 1.5, "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 14, "fontWeight": "normal"}, {"type": "text", "id": "C4uJt", "name": "Note 4", "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "选中 = 淡橙底 + 右侧 ↩；悬停 = 中性灰底，单击即粘贴。", "lineHeight": 1.5, "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 14, "fontWeight": "normal"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rACPr", "name": "Note 5", "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "420 pt 宽，行高 44 pt，13 行一屏。", "lineHeight": 1.5, "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 14, "fontWeight": "normal"}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "Q9aNF5", "x": 1140, "y": 4700, "name": "F2 · Dark · Selected", "theme": {"mode": "dark"}, "clip": true, "width": 1040, "height": 800, "fill": {"type": "mesh_gradient", "enabled": true, "columns": 3, "rows": 3, "colors": ["$w1", "$w5", "$w2", "$w4", "$w1", "$w6", "$w3", "$w4", "$w2"], "points": [[0, 0], [0.5, 0], [1, 0], [0, 0.5], [0.42, 0.58], [1, 0.5], [0, 1], [0.5, 1], [1, 1]]}, "layout": "none", "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "agDKa", "x": 150, "y": 70, "name": "Panel", "clip": true, "width": 420, "fill": "$glass", "cornerRadius": 18, "stroke": "$glass-stroke"